Hi there,

When using package.skeleton.dx("myPkg") with the setClass method,
the title field is not being written to the Rd file.  Without the title, the check
function complains and quits.  I'm on OS X Lion, btw.

Maybe an additional argument not to clobber existing files would be nice.
Then I wouldn't have to fix this over and over.

Thanks!!  Let me know if you need any additional info.
-dave


Here's what's happening:


setClass("pepnet",
         ### The pepnet class will hold all the results from peptide network calculations
         representation(adjmat = "matrix", ##<< the adjacency matrix
                        tom = "matrix",    ##<< the topological overlap matrix
                        peptides = "character" ##<< the names of the peptides 
		)
         )



